  "title": "Impossible Baked Chimichangas",
  "description": "These chimichangas are stuffed with a basic filling of spices, cheese, beans, Impossible Burger, salsa, and then baked for a healthier favorite.",
  "authors": [
    "sanzoe"
  ],
